[statement]
Observed; the rule is not yet known. Reduced from Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-08), asked for `mpv-dev`. `so:libjack.so.0`, which
`mpv-libs` needs, is reached before `pc:jack`, and `jack` provides it at the
later version, yet apk installs `pipewire-jack` for it: `pipewire-jack-dev`,
the best candidate for `pc:jack`, needs `pipewire-jack`. The shape of
`decision-order/a-later-name-whose-best-candidate-needs-a-candidate-steers-
an-earlier-one`.

